Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.97,0:00:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.45,0:00:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on the move!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.29,0:01:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for flying, and please\Nenjoy your stay here in Cairo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.21,0:01:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I just flew all the way to Egypt, and\Nboy, are my arms tired. Spare us, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.59,0:01:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold up a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.13,0:01:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.09,0:01:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.00,0:01:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We haven't even left the airport,\Nand she's shopping already?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.05,0:01:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'll take that snow globe\Nwith the pyramids. Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.13,0:01:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone here knows we're tourists now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.03,0:01:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,So are they.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.51,0:01:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.21,0:01:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's Merrick! What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.69,0:01:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Long time no see, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.57,0:01:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, there's so much to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.59,0:01:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Where do we begin?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.57,0:01:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let's start with lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.39,0:01:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,How are the burger joints out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.23,0:01:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,May I speak with the pharaoh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.39,0:01:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,My king, welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.29,0:01:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You've finally come home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.95,0:01:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You have quite a long journey ahead,\Nand we're so honored to be your guides.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.13,0:02:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, the pleasure's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.77,0:02:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.13,0:02:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's what a great pyramid looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.69,0:02:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.60,0:02:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be the Sphinx!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.83,0:02:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to his nose?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.31,0:02:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.37,0:02:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, like you do? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.61,0:02:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond this door lies the\Ntablet of lost memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.67,0:02:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,All the secrets of my past\Nwill finally be revealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.91,0:02:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You must enter without us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.13,0:02:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And when you reach the tablet,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.77,0:02:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,hold up your Egyptian god cards, and the\Ngateway to your lost memories will open.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.59,0:02:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,From here on, you must forge\Nyour own path, my pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.55,0:02:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.46,0:02:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.51,0:02:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a weird feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.57,0:02:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That's because you ate all those falafels.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.89,0:02:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess our job as tomb\Nkeepers is finally complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.91,0:02:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Our ancestors have awaited\Nthis for 5,000 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.11,0:02:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.45,0:02:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a place where every\Nsoul must eventually return,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.93,0:03:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,and the Pharaoh has just begun\Nthe journey to his resting place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.41,0:03:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.99,0:03:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the gateway and seal your fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.95,0:03:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd think they could\Nspruce this place up a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.99,0:03:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, for a 5,000-year-old\Nsanctuary, it could be worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.71,0:03:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,There it is, the tablet of lost memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.49,0:03:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,poor guy his spirit's been around\Nfor like centuries but his memory
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.21,0:03:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,only goes back a few years i mean\Nhe had this whole other life in
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.71,0:03:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,ancient egypt and he doesn't remember\Nany of it not even his own name
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.83,0:03:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh, I want you to have this.\NWhat is it? It's a cartoon cartouche.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.83,0:03:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The guy in the store said ancient pharaohs\Nused to carve their names on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.99,0:03:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But this cartouche is\Ncompletely blank, Taya. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.91,0:04:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I bought it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.15,0:04:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I figured that when you get your memory\Nback, you can put your name there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.21,0:04:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That way you can be sure\Nyou'll never forget it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.89,0:04:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I remembered seeing a picture\Nof one on that tablet,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.93,0:04:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,but the name on it was worn away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.17,0:04:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But hopefully soon, your life\Nwon't be a mystery anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.77,0:04:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.91,0:04:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never take it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.85,0:04:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,According to the prophecy,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.59,0:04:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,as soon as I raise the three Egyptian god\Ncards before the Tablet of Lost Memories,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.21,0:04:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,my mind will be unlocked, and the\Nsecrets of my past will be revealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.05,0:04:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.97,0:04:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The portion of my spirit\NI once infused within
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.17,0:04:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,the Millennium Puzzle\Nwill finally be released,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.93,0:04:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,and then the Shadow Game can begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.87,0:05:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Go for it, Yuge.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.43,0:05:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And no matter what happens,\Nwe're right behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.59,0:05:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.27,0:05:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are the Egyptian gods taking me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.27,0:05:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like my plan worked
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.85,0:06:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I take it that was supposed to happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.39,0:06:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but thanks to that light I\Nthink I'm gonna be seeing double for weeks
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.17,0:06:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi! You alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.01,0:06:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, pal. Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.83,0:06:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gone! Say, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.99,0:06:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.11,0:06:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.39,0:06:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Pharaoh. He left. You're kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.81,0:06:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The boy is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.65,0:06:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The Pharaoh is now in\Nthe world of his memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.63,0:06:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.93,0:06:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.84,0:06:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.97,0:06:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're that guy in the\Nbathrobe from Battle City.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.11,0:06:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan, we're done for! It's all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.13,0:06:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's got my hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.91,0:06:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you guys I didn't imagine him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.75,0:06:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, how do we know\Nwe can trust this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.13,0:06:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.89,0:07:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoddy's the guardian\Nof the Millennium Items!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.57,0:07:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.09,0:07:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Your public awaits, my king.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.33,0:07:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The citizens of Egypt are quite anxious\Nto pay respect to their new pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.55,0:07:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you say their pharaoh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.18,0:08:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We've prepared a lovely\Nceremony in your honor, my king.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.09,0:08:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Might I suggest you settle down in\Nyour throne and enjoy the festivities?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.29,0:08:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, it's the big old chair straight ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.11,0:08:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I actually travel back in time?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.01,0:08:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,All hail the new pharaoh,\Nexalted ruler of Egypt!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.17,0:08:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.49,0:08:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Isshizu?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.79,0:08:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.49,0:08:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.39,0:08:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,My pharaoh, perhaps we should\Npostpone the celebration.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.39,0:08:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That won't be necessary.\NPlease, carry on. Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.45,0:08:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The time has come.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.39,0:09:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us all welcome his\Nexcellence to the throne of
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.09,0:09:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Egypt with the ceremonial\Nfestival of the pharaohs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.49,0:09:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,All of these people work for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.23,0:09:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.27,0:09:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Each one of you holds a Millennium Item?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.03,0:09:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.55,0:09:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,These are the six members\Nof your secret court.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.19,0:09:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,They were chosen by the\NMillennium Items themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.15,0:09:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Each one destined to wield its\Npower in the name of the Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.51,0:09:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.99,0:09:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no rest for the wicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.59,0:09:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.75,0:09:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems our little friend\Nhas collapsed again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.65,0:09:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Just my luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.79,0:09:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a grand celebration at the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.33,0:09:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And I get stuck hauling a\Npetty thief to the dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.49,0:10:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.63,0:10:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.63,0:10:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, by the looks of these chains,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.61,0:10:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,it appears my timing\Ncould have been better.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.11,0:10:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But regardless, my journey into\Nthe ancient past was a success.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.83,0:10:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You are free, my lord
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.55,0:10:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I see that. Now if memory serves me,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.37,0:10:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,There's work to be done.\NIt's been a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.25,0:10:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But I remember this day\Nfrom my past quite clearly
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.19,0:10:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the day the great\Npharaoh inherited the throne
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.17,0:11:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,of Egypt And he and I have\Nsome catching up to do
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.09,0:11:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Have I actually been\Ntransported back in time?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.39,0:11:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Or is all this happening in my mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.19,0:11:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The people here seem so familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.61,0:11:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps my experiences in the 21st century
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.09,0:11:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,have somehow affected\Nmy memories of the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.29,0:11:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Or could it be that these people\Nreally did live 5,000 years ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.05,0:11:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Take Kaiba, for instance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.83,0:11:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,He always seemed to have a\Nconnection with ancient Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.95,0:11:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And the fact that his image was etched in\Nthat tablet can hardly be a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.49,0:11:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Mahat, quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.53,0:12:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Guard, stop that intruder now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.51,0:12:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,He is getting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.67,0:12:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring this scoundrel before the pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.69,0:12:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Assaulting the king of Egypt\Nis an inexcusable crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.77,0:12:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We are in the midst of a sacred ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.29,0:12:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Cast this man to the dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.87,0:12:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.13,0:12:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a better idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.09,0:12:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us use this rogue to demonstrate for
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.17,0:12:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,the new pharaoh the full\Nextent of our power.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.57,0:12:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you agree, Master\NAk-Nadden, Master Shimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.85,0:12:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.11,0:12:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,So let it be written, so let it be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.23,0:12:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Let this man's judgment begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.97,0:12:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.88,0:12:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Commence with the millennium\Ntrial of this man's soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.83,0:12:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,A millennium trial?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.91,0:12:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, my king.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.29,0:12:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,With a position of great power\Noften comes great danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.81,0:13:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And criminals that threaten the ruler\Nof Egypt must be dealt with accordingly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.35,0:13:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But you need not be alarmed, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.21,0:13:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We, the members of your sacred court, are\Nhere to ensure your safety at all times.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.03,0:13:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Thou shall now be judged by the dark\Nmagic of the Seven Millennium Items!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.21,0:13:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What does he plan to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.51,0:13:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Shadow will start.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.91,0:13:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, with the power of the Millennium\NKey, I shall read your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.31,0:13:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The shadow of an evil creature\Nlurks inside his heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.31,0:13:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall now invoke the\Nenergies of the Millennium Eye,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.05,0:13:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,thus revealing and extracting\Nthe being that dwells within.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.89,0:13:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.67,0:13:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The Millennium Items\Nhave detected a shadow
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.09,0:13:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,creature dwelling in the\Nheart of this criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.43,0:14:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Little is known about\Nthese beings of darkness,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.43,0:14:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,only that they feed on the\Nanger and hatred of humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.57,0:14:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Once a shadow creature is born, it\Nforces its host to commit acts of evil,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.43,0:14:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,creating even more darkness to feast upon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.81,0:14:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,So the guardians of the Sacred\NCourt use the Millennium
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.01,0:14:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Items to seal these monsters\Nwithin stone tablets.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.19,0:14:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Could those be the same\Ntablets from my visions?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.19,0:14:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Seto,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.59,0:14:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,call upon the power of your Millennium Rod\Nand seal the fate of this shadow beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.75,0:14:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.69,0:14:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,A creature from the realm of darkness\Nhas no place in this kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.15,0:14:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Millennium Rod,\Nrelinquish this beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.65,0:14:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I beseech thee.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.93,0:15:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.05,0:15:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Can this be the origin of Duel Monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.27,0:15:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,So now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.83,0:15:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The Pharaoh must relive his ancient past.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.99,0:15:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the only way he\Ncan fulfill his destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.13,0:15:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,But this journey is a\Ngift as well as a curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.31,0:15:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, shoddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.89,0:15:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The Pharaoh will finally\Nlearn about his past.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.11,0:15:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,but he must defeat the\Ngreat evil all over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.27,0:15:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.55,0:15:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to find him and bring\Nhim back to the present.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.49,0:15:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You cannot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.71,0:15:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that he is in the\Nrealm of his memories,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.27,0:15:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,the only way he may return\Nis by reigning victorious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.03,0:15:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Victorious at what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.51,0:15:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The ultimate shadow game.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.61,0:15:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,A battle that decides not only his\Nown fate, but the fate of mankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.25,0:15:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.16,0:15:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The Pharaoh came here to\Nfind out who he really is,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.97,0:15:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,not to put himself in danger again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.39,0:15:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean to tell me you\Nknew what he was getting
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.55,0:16:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,himself into all along\Nand you still let him go?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.99,0:16:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.19,0:16:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy's some kind of a hologram.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.07,0:16:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,No, actually, I'm a centuries-old spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.91,0:16:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.82,0:16:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Why am I the only one who's freaked\Nout that we're talking to a ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.79,0:16:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, let him speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.67,0:16:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,My earthly body was destroyed by a\Ntomb robber named Bakura. Bakura?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.03,0:16:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.99,0:16:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He, too, is an ancient soul, a\Nwandering spirit, if you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.61,0:16:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But he wants to use the\NMillennium Items for evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.37,0:16:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,To do what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.01,0:16:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,To release a creature\Nof ultimate darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.21,0:16:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And so, when the Pharaoh began his\Njourney into the realm of his memories,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.43,0:16:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,the spirit of Bakura followed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.65,0:16:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, so Bakura's back\Nthere with the Pharaoh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.13,0:16:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.11,0:16:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,He plans to use the Millennium\NItems to dominate the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.43,0:16:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,No, he can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.51,0:16:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, the pharaoh beat him the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.81,0:16:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Yook?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.99,0:16:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Just because it happened\Nin the past doesn't
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.41,0:17:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,mean it's guaranteed to\Nhappen the same way again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.11,0:17:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true, and I hate to say it,\Nguys, but if the past is destroyed,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.21,0:17:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,so is the future. She's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.43,0:17:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to go back to the past and\Nmake sure the pharaoh defeats Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.79,0:17:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,There is only one way to enter\Nthe realm of the pharaoh's memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.53,0:17:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The doorway lies in the Millennium Puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.69,0:17:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,How are we supposed to find it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.43,0:17:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, my young friends,\Nand I will be your guide.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.85,0:17:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,One can never be dressed too\Nformally with visiting a palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.51,0:17:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And since I wouldn't want\Nto show up empty-handed,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.37,0:17:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll bring this sarcophagus\Nalong as a peace offering.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.45,0:17:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the king awaits,\Nand we mustn't be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.97,0:17:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.15,0:17:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Master Akhenaten.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.33,0:17:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that we are done with him, let\Nus banish this fool to the dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.17,0:18:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We have expelled the\Ndarkness from his heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.31,0:18:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore, it is the duty of the Pharaoh's\Nsacred court to let this man walk free.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.07,0:18:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Release him!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.21,0:18:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,If I am not mistaken, Mahad, palace\Nsecurity is your responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.31,0:18:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you would like to shed some\Nlight on this afternoon's events.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.21,0:18:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,How did that intruder make\Nit past the royal guard?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.83,0:18:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Seto is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.71,0:18:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Please accept my apologies, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.75,0:18:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The Millennium Ring has been\Nbehaving quite strangely as of late,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.77,0:18:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,making it difficult to\Ndetect criminal activity.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.11,0:18:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,May I have your permission to increase\Nsecurity forces to fortify the city, my king?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.59,0:18:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course. Please do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.15,0:18:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Now store that creature\Nin the Tablet Sanctuary!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.13,0:18:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Who was that intruder?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.89,0:18:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And will there be others?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.07,0:18:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Andro,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.98,0:18:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,might I suggest that we move\Non and continue with the
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.01,0:19:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,coronation festivities as\Nquickly as we possibly can? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.79,0:19:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just attacked! That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.41,0:19:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,However, if your loyal followers sense\Nyour fear, they too will feel unsafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.85,0:19:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And the best way to hide that fear\Nis with merriment and laughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.09,0:19:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.13,0:19:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try. Let the festival of the pharaohs\Ncontinue. Wait, is there a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.23,0:19:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Isis?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.71,0:19:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,My millennium necklace senses an evil\Nforce approaching the kingdom How close?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.39,0:19:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Shimon, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.07,0:19:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,This being lurks just outside the\Npalace walls And he bears a great power
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.47,0:19:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's time we made our\Npresence known, don't you agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.39,0:19:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.11,0:19:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let the ultimate shadow game begin!
